       +----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
       @note The max SPI frequency depend on SPI data size (4bits, 5bits,..., 8bits,...15bits, 16bits),
             SPI mode(2 Lines fullduplex, 2 lines RxOnly, 1 line TX/RX) and Process mode (Polling, IT, DMA).
